flowchart TD
    Plan[Retain planned chunk hashes and frozen gate counts]
    Open[Shard running: evaluation outcomes may already fail]
    Receipt[Chunk transaction: fence writers and commit immutable receipt]
    Work{Pending receipts or canonical fold ready?}
    Budget{Ready page and database scheduling budgets available?}
    Claim{Coordinator page claim available?}
    Next[Visit unchecked shards; revisit only remaining ready work; bounded concurrency]
    Drain[Await admitted pages under database deadlines]
    Wait[Wait for remaining shard settlement]
    Progress[Consume bounded receipt page; commit counters and identities]
    All{Every planned receipt accounted for?}
    Fold[Resume canonical fold and validate exact membership]
    Folded{Canonical fold complete and valid?}
    Seal[Seal immutable shard summary with missing and unresolved counts]
    Read[Finalization reads published summaries by database]
    Ready{Exact set of valid seals and drained dispatch?}
    Final[Claim run; commit partial or complete report, gate, and one event]
    Plan --> Open --> Receipt --> Work
    Work -- No --> Drain
    Work -- Yes --> Budget
    Budget -- Yes --> Claim
    Budget -- No --> Drain
    Claim -- No --> Next
    Claim -- Yes --> All
    All -- No --> Progress --> Next
    All -- Yes --> Fold --> Folded
    Folded -- No --> Next
    Folded -- Yes --> Seal --> Next
    Next --> Budget
    Drain --> Read --> Ready
    Ready -- No --> Wait
    Ready -- Yes --> Final
